<title>POLAND: CENTROSTAL TURNS TO PROFIT IN MARCH.</title>
<headline>CENTROSTAL TURNS TO PROFIT IN MARCH.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results March </p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> MARCH		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.13 vs   0.05 loss</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.22 vs   0.02 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.26 vs   0.47</p>
<p> Sales		    8.27 vs   8.37</p>
<p> JANUARY-MARCH	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.31 vs   0.14</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.51 vs   0.30</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.20 vs   1.23</p>
<p> Sales		   23.44 vs  24.75</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish steel trader is Centrostal</p>
<p>Gdansk SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
